Z||000000||MrPBody||02-18-2001||12:55 PM||||Thanks to <B>william_thorniii</B> for telling us about this event!  I think <B>1FST2M6</B> and I were the only Fiero enthusiasts.<P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ra_0002.jpg"> <P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ra_0003.jpg"> <P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ra_0004.jpg"> <P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ra_0001.jpg"> <P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ra_0005.jpg"> <BR>Approaching the bridge<P><BR>Sorry I don't have more track photos.  (No telephoto.)<P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||bHooper||02-18-2001||02:06 PM||||ooh, ahh... Road Atlanta!  What a beautifull track!<P>i was there in '95 when Jeromy Dale T-boned Fabrizzo Barbatza (in his 333 SP) right in front of me, at the exit of turn 12. <P>i will have to find my photo's and scan them.<P>that was a scarry wreck!<P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT<BR>KYB's, Eibach's,<BR>Poly Bushings||||reg||1
Z||000002||Wade87GT||02-19-2001||01:37 PM||||bHooper, I was at that race too. I was overlooking pit lane at the time of the crash and got the whole thing on video tape. The in-camera shot from TV was also incredible. It's amazing both drivers lived from that one.||||reg||1
Z||000003||bHooper||02-19-2001||04:34 PM||||i allways set in turn 12 (or old pit entrance), there was always a lot of action there.<P>i have the photo of the moment b4 impact, and the moment after.  my buddy snapped the actual impact with the hood in the air.<P>Jeromy Dale has been a color comentator ever since, I have not heard anything about Fabrizzo Barbazza.<P>i will have to find my photo's.  they are in b&w, i have the moment b4 impact enlarged to a 20 something by 30 something and framed.  i also taped the race.<P><P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT<BR>KYB's, Eibach's,<BR>Poly Bushings||||reg||1
Z||000004||MrPBody||02-19-2001||09:17 PM||||This is my first visit to RA since Panoz revised the track layout.  Amenities are better for sure.  (The old restrooms were falling apart.)  I'm not crazy about catch fences and revisions to Turns 10 and 11, but the track probably is safer now.  Turn 11 (Bridge) used to be pretty scary!<BR>||||reg||1
